  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe new Expression Menu seems to be quite buggy and tend to break a lot for me. They also produce quite a lot of Error Logs.\n\nThe only way I found to repeatability break them was by restarting Unity, I tried this in multiple new Projects.\n\nOne thing to note is that as soon as it's broken the Icon for it in the Project Tab is also gone.\n\nAnother thing to note is that another person had the same issue but it just randomly started working for them and others don't have this issue at all.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Make a new Project using the beta SDK\n\n2. Create a new Expression Menu with a few things in it\n\n   - should still work as normal at this point\n\n3. Restart Unity\n\n   - Expression Menu is now broken\n\nCreating a new Expression Menu also works even after the first restart, but as soon as I restart again it breaks.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThey should still work normally, even after restarting the Project.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a download link to a project with broken Expression Menus inside. If you can't download this due to security reasons please let me know what else I can do to provide examples.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1A88zvYjWdBuRgPPzrhfdUUMWJi__r6Ct/view?usp=sharing\n\nHere are a few screenshots showing the broken Menus and Error messages:",
